                                     GTM_TOM_CHANNEL_USED_BY_MCU: Specifies that this Channel is configured by GTM MCU module.&lt;br/&gt;
                                     GTM_TOM_CHANNEL_USED_BY_PWM: Specifies that this Channel is configured by PWM module.&lt;br/&gt;
